Description: native graphical multi-provider AI agent written in Rust
 GnomeAI-RS provides a native desktop coding agent and optional WhatsApp
 assistant with shared providers, Web Search, persistent memory and installable
 SKILL.md packages.
 .
 The package bundles the official OpenAI Codex app-server runtime, the pinned
 WhatsApp bridge dependencies and a rootless, lazy Firecrawl deployment with
 complete corresponding AGPL source.
